: 0, "responses": [{"_data": [{"type": "text", "content": ""}], "correct": 1, "selected": 0, "id": 0}]}], "type": "DWS", "template_override": 1}], "stimuli": [{"_data": [], "type": "welcome", "template_override": 1, "contents": [{}], "id": 0}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "time": "100", "text": "Friends, professors, administrators, and parents, welcome.To the class of 20\u2026we did it. We finally graduated.", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "time": "11500", "text": "Today marks the end of one chapter and the beginning of a new one in the book of life.<br>\nIt just seems like last year, that we sat nervously in our first class, anticipating difficult classes and challenging professors. All of those nights we crammed for the test the next morning, all of the books we read and the essays we wrote, all of the lessons we learned from not only our professors, but our friends as well. Now, we stand with confidence.  We will use the skills and training we gained to meet life head on.", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "time": "48500", "text": "It's remarkable, isn't it? I think I speak for most of us when I say that the past four years went by faster than we ever imagined.  I remember being a freshman and thinking about how long college would take; but the thing is, I remember thinking about that as if it was last week. We will all take different paths; some might move on to MBA degrees,  others may begin internships and paid positions. We all share memories and incredible experiences that will last us a lifetime.<br>\n<br>Best of luck to all of you as we move closer to our future goals.", "id": 3}], "audiosrc": "engenn5le13ob08re2aud01", "coverimg": ""}, "type": "slideshow"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 1}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "time": "0", "text": "Friends, professors, administrators, and parents, welcome.</br>To the class of 2000 ... we did it. We finally graduated.</br>", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "time": "11250", "text": "Today marks the end of one chapter and the beginning of a new one in the book of life. It just seems like only last year, that we sat nervously in our first class, anticipating difficult classes and challenging professors. Do you remember those nights we crammed? There were so many tests! There were so many books to read! Finally, the essays! We all spent hours in the library writing those! I know we all learned a lot from our professors, but we also learned from each other. Now, we stand with confidence. We now have the skills and training that we will be able use to meet life head on.", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "time": "54250", "text": "It's remarkable, isn't it? I am sure that we can all agree that the past four years went by quickly. It's astonishing!  I remember sitting on the lawn on my first day as a freshman. I kept looking around, thinking that college would take forever. That memory is still with me, but it feels like it was was just last week. We will all take different paths; some might move on to MBA degrees, others may begin internships and paid positions.", "id": 3}, {"image": "", "time": "86500", "text": "We will all share memories and incredible experiences that will last us a lifetime.", "id": 4}], "video_src": "engenn5le13ob08re2vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 2}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": "", "type": "img"}], "type": "audio", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 3}, {"_data": [], "contents": [{"value": {"images": [{"image": "", "time": "0", "text": "", "id": 0}, {"image": "", "time": "5000", "text": "Writing a Speech", "id": 1}, {"image": "", "time": "16000", "text": "</li><li> Include an introduction", "id": 2}, {"image": "", "time": "42000", "text": "</li><li> Include main points", "id": 3}, {"image": "", "time": "63000", "text": "</li><li> Include transitions", "id": 4}], "video_src": "engenn5le13ob08re3vid01"}, "type": "video"}], "type": "video", "template_override": 1, "title": "", "id": 4}]}]}